feat: Meta Includes (#44)

## Summary

- Fixed CLI commands to properly load meta items from included files
- Meta includes were already implemented in the parser but CLI was using
wrong accessor
- Added comprehensive integration tests for includes functionality

The parser (`src/parser/meta.ts`) already supported the `includes` field
and properly loaded items from included files. However, CLI commands
were incorrectly accessing `metaCtx.manifest.agents` (which only
contains items from the main manifest file) instead of `metaCtx.agents`
(which contains items from both manifest and all included files).

**Changes:**
- Fixed all meta CLI commands to use
`metaCtx.agents/workflows/conventions/observations` directly
- Added 5 integration tests covering: loading from includes, glob
patterns, missing files, cross-file reference validation
- All 61 meta tests passing (1 skipped)

