feat: Implement Link Management Commands (#34)

## Summary

Implements link management commands for kspec:
- `kspec link create` - Create relationships between spec items
- `kspec link list` - Query relationships with filtering options
- `kspec link delete` - Remove relationships

## Implementation

The commands manage three relationship types on spec items:
- `depends_on` - Dependencies between items
- `implements` - Implementation relationships
- `relates_to` - General relationships

Key features:
- Proper reference resolution with error handling
- Forward and reverse lookups (--from and --to)
- Type filtering for targeted queries  
- Duplicate relationship detection
- Shadow branch auto-commit integration
- JSON mode support for programmatic use

## Test Coverage

Added 9 integration tests covering:
- Creating relationships
- Listing from/to an item
- Filtering by type
- Deleting relationships
