docs: use subagents for reference directory exploration

Reference directories can be large - agents should use Explore subagents
to search for related prior work rather than loading everything directly.
This prevents context bloat while still benefiting from prior implementations.

docs: clarify PR review workflow for ralph loop agents

Agents were misinterpreting "don't merge your own unless trivial" as
"skip review and move on" rather than "ensure proper review happens."

Updated to require:
- Dedicated review subagent using /review for each PR
- Clear decision tree based on PR authorship
- Recursive review cycle for non-trivial fixes
- Explicit clarification that every PR should be reviewed and merged

