feat: auto-configure shadow tracking from main branch remote

AC-7/AC-8: When shadow branch has no tracking but main branch has
an origin remote, automatically configure tracking to origin/kspec-meta.

This happens on any sync operation (shadowPull, shadowPushAsync),
so tracking is set up opportunistically when a remote becomes available.

Implementation:
- ensureRemoteTracking() checks and configures tracking if needed
- shadowPull() fetches and checks remote branch existence before pull
- Handles case where remote branch doesn't exist yet (nothing to pull)

