Initial design specification for Kynetic Spec

Comprehensive design document covering:
- YAML format with Zod schema validation
- ULID + slug ID system
- Hybrid hierarchy + graph relationships
- First-class task system with notes, todos, VCS linking
- Library-first architecture (TypeScript)
- Auto-adaptive file structure
- Unix-style primitive design philosophy

Includes research notes on:
- Format comparison (YAML vs XML vs RDF vs JSON)
- Task management systems (Beads, BMAD, Spec Kit, Linear)
- Traceability and versioning best practices
- CLI design patterns

